{"availability":"available","full":"Beomi/KoAlpaca","name":"KoAlpaca","description":"KoAlpaca: 한국어 명령어를 이해하는 오픈소스 언어모델 (KoAlpaca: An open-source language model to understand Korean instructions)","category":"Other","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":1572,"forks":222,"created":"2023-03-18T04:48:40Z","updated":"2024-10-25T07:59:42Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["alpaca","chatkoalpaca","koalpaca","korean-nlp","llama","polyglot-ko"],"demo":"https://crfm.stanford.edu/alpaca/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.232Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.232Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.232Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:22.041Z","stars":1572,"forks":223},{"at":"2026-10-07T23:29:25.926Z","stars":1572,"forks":222},{"at":"2026-10-10T01:07:40.482Z","stars":1572,"forks":222},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.232Z","stars":1572,"forks":222}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🐧KoAlpaca-KoRWKV-6B 허깅페이스 레포🤗에 몇가지 생성 결과 샘플이 있습니다.","The current Alpaca model is fine-tuned from a 7B LLaMA model [1] on 52K instruction-following data generated by the techniques in the Self-Instruct [2] paper, with some modifications that we discuss in the next section. In a preliminary human evaluation, we found that the Alpaca 7B model behaves similarly to the text-davinci-003 model on the Self-Instruct instruction-following evaluation suite [2].","Alpaca is still under development, and there are many limitations that have to be addressed. Importantly, we have not yet fine-tuned the Alpaca model to be safe and harmless. We thus encourage users to be cautious when interacting with Alpaca, and to report any concerning behavior to help improve the safety and ethical considerations of the model."],"features":["GPU 서버 지원 종료로 웹앱 데모를 종료합니다.","RTX3090(4090/A5000) 4대 사용한 TensorParallel 기반 학습 예제 코드 추가","Colab Free(T4 GPU)에서 로드 가능합니다.","예제로 🤗beomi/qlora-koalpaca-polyglot-12.8b-50step 레포(50step 학습한 예제)를 사용합니다.","Colab 무료 - T4에서는 50sample에 약 4분, 1epoch에 약 15시간(최대 사용시간 초과)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Beomi/KoAlpaca/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7eca10c99657e09e8137b256fc3c4d0da09de31cdb6749efd92207dae6b6ef2c","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:32:22.172Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.313Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"🐧KoAlpaca-KoRWKV-6B 허깅페이스 레포🤗에 몇가지 생성 결과 샘플이 있습니다.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Beomi/KoAlpaca/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7eca10c99657e09e8137b256fc3c4d0da09de31cdb6749efd92207dae6b6ef2c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Beomi/KoAlpaca/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.314Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-10-25T07:59:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Beomi/KoAlpaca/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.315Z","hash":"7eca10c99657e09e8137b256fc3c4d0da09de31cdb6749efd92207dae6b6ef2c","originalBytes":37073,"storedBytes":37073,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:32.232Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://crfm.stanford.edu/alpaca/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","target":"https://alpaca-ai.ngrok.io/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T00:11:09.130Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://crfm.stanford.edu/alpaca/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T00:11:09.130Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/e8837a632fac128fb1dcba9e.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-13T00:11:09.130Z","url":"https://crfm.stanford.edu/alpaca/"}],"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:26:23.628Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:26:23.628Z","subjects":[],"classification":{"versi